dsh-pets
========

This plugin contains code ported from OpenAI Codex:

  - The desktop-pet animation engine (state machine, sprite-sheet frame
    mapping and animation sequencing in lib/client.js, generated from
    src/client.template.js) is ported from the "guga" desktop pet in
    OpenAI Codex (https://github.com/openai/codex, codex-rs/tui/src/pets).

